{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32146","headline":"春洲曲 · 温庭筠","name":"春洲曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韶光染色如蛾翠，绿湿红鲜水容媚。\n苏小慵多兰渚闲，融融浦日鵁鶄寐。\n紫骝蹀躞金衔嘶，岸上扬鞭烟草迷。\n门外平桥连柳堤，归来晚树黄莺啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}